{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"へーい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/05/0111974/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/05/0111974/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近急激にカクレモモジリのグッズが増えてきて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなからキモイ言われますでも全くと言っていいほど気にしていません！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみあみだよーー！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏ーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"浴衣きたい。(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみ浴衣似合うと思う？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んー今度着たら載っけてみよう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみね、浴衣着てる男の人素敵だと思う(@￣ρ￣@)きゅん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じんべいじゃなくて浴衣が良いの！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやぁー夏って素晴らしい。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お祭り行きたいなぁーー海行きたいなーープール行きたいなーー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/05/0111974/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ニヤニヤ♪(´ε｀ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返し！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.あみあみはイヌ派?ネコ派?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.犬も捨てがたいけど・・・あみはやっぱり猫派かなあ？？動物はみんな可愛いんですよ。にっこり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.なんで髪切ったのかが気になる＞＜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"答えてくれたら嬉しいです☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.んーーちょっとね、雰囲気を変えてみたかったんだよね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/05/0111974/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"！気分転換ってのも、ある！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.前のブログのパンケーキはエッグスンシングスン？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.おっ！わかった？？良かったら行ってみて(*^^*)ね(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.オムライス♪以外で好きな料理得意な料理有る？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.ゆでたまご！！なーんちて。てん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シューマイとか、ピザとか作ったりするよぉぉでへ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.お魚で好きな魚って有るの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.お魚しゃんは、ブリの照り焼き(^_^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれはうみゃい！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.挑戦してみたい服装は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.えー以外とブリブリの服とかきてみたかったり(￣▽￣)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみはね、いろんな系統を着こなせるようになりたいのー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.オーディション♪からもうすぐ１年だけどオーディションからどんな１年だった？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.かぁなり成長したと思うん自分でも。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"泣いてばっかの時もあったし、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"始めて味わう幸せな気持ちにもなれたり。普通の高校生やってたらこんないろんな気持ち味わえなかっただろうなって思うよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.この１年で一番記憶に残った事は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.始めてzepp東京でパフォーマンスしたときかな？あんなたくさんの人達の前で、なにかをするなんて始めてだったから ( ◞˟૩˟)◞"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.狼の歌詞の意味♪アミ&iF9E7;ちゃんの感じた事教えてください"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.あの曲って実はものっそい深い意味が込められてる歌詞なんだよね(^_^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみは、人を恨んだり、過去を振り返ったりしないで、笑顔を忘れず、今を全力で生きる！！ってな感じの事を感じた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.あみちゃんコメしっかり読んでますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.隅から隅まで、しっっかり見てますよ？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.どんな梅干しが好きですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.はちみつの味ー！あまぁいのが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好き。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.あみあみの好きな色は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.んっとーね、赤！ラッキーカラーだからね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.メンバーの中で娘にするなら、誰ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.あすかかなぁ(´･_･`)あんな可愛い娘いたらあみなんでもしちゃう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はここまでっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいばいあみあみ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみ"}],"source":"archive"}